The first direct build matched the charged sparse chart exactly: 12 unknowns, 21 equations, the same gauges and support, and target coefficient `0` before subtracting `c`, hence the tagged equation `-c`. The remaining two partitions are being generated sequentially in the same foreground process; no CAS basis job has started yet.
